4. Exile up to X target cards from graveyards\n\
\n\
They're targeting me with Kozilek's Command. I should probably respond with Lightning Bolt to try to kill them (they're at 10 life, I have 8/8 and 4/4 attackers, plus Lightning Bolt is 3 damage = lethal). But Lightning Bolt is sorcery speed... wait no, it's instant speed! I can cast Lightning Bolt in response to Kozilek's Command.\n\
\n\
But I'm at 13 life (lost 2 from Thoughtseize). My Orc Army Token is 8/8, Marauding Mako is 4/4, that's 12 damage. They're at 10 life. If I attack with both, that's lethal (12 > 10). But if they have Kozilek's Command resolve with \"exile target creature with mana value X or less\", they could exile my Orc Army Token (MV 0) or Marauding Mako (MV 2). Actually Marauding Mako is MV 2, so X=2 can exile it. Or they could make tokens to block.\n\
\n\
I should Bolt them now! Lightning Bolt deals 3 damage, bringing them to 7 life. Then my attackers deal 12 damage, which is lethal even if they exile one creature (12 - 4 = 8 > 7).\n\
\n\
Actually wait, if they choose \"exile target creature with mana value X or less\" with X=2, they can exile Marauding Mako. Then I have 8 damage (Orc Army) vs 7 life, still lethal.\n\
\n\
But if they choose to create 2 Eldrazi Spawn tokens (0/1), they could chump block my 8/8 with two tokens. That would only deal 8 damage, which is still lethal vs 7 life.\n\
\n\
I should cast Lightning Bolt in response to Kozilek's Command:\n\
\n\
\n\
\n\
